WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.332
PostgreSQL 18: Sinov jadvali va vazifalar

00:12.332 --> 00:23.135
ORDER BY va NULLS LAST amaliyoti

00:23.135 --> 00:36.148
LIMIT va OFFSET bilan barqaror sahifalash

00:36.148 --> 00:47.469
FETCH FIRST va WITH TIES amaliyoti

00:47.469 --> 00:57.634
Bir nechta ustun bo‘yicha saralash

00:57.634 --> 01:10.140
Amaliy xulosalar va tavsiyalar
